      "Language": "spa",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "He was a patient with 3,065 lesions of different sizes on the skin, placed in arms, legs, sternum area and right thorax, since he was 22 years old. The leiomyomas were painful and with electrical sensation, when you touch them. Faint. He denied similar lesions in relatives. We found abnormal brain vessels and bone tumor in right petrous bone."},
